# [OAUTH](../wg/oauth.html)

## Summary

The OAUTH Working Group held an interim meeting on September 21, 2026, to discuss OAuth in the context of agentic and Large Language Model (LLM) use cases. The session focused on a joint presentation by Anthropic and OpenAI outlining real-world integration challenges, including client registration friction, consent fatigue, principal selection/cardinality, and fine-grained scoping.

